-- the vertical flux of the volume fraction
-$$
-\displaystyle
-\mathcal{F}(t) = \frac{1}{L}\int_{-\infty}^{\infty} \overline{\phi(\mathbf{x},t)u_z(\mathbf{x},t)}~dz
-$$
